  "href": "strategic_game/strategic_game_smooth_game.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Smooth Game</h1>\n<p>For a game whose strategy sets are convex subsets of Hilbert spaces, the game is\nsmooth if, for every player $i$ and fixed $s_{-i}$, the map\n$$\n  s_i\\mapsto g_i(s_i,s_{-i})\n$$\nis $C^1$. It is concave if these maps are concave.</p>",
